description = "A method of a `class` the kernel is not given runs as written, so a function calling it runs as written too, even when its types are the kernel's."

@ cases.to-text-of-a-kernel-text-runs-as-written
files."main.taut" = ```tauto
import std::text
import std::builtin::classes
fn f(name: Text): Text { Text::concat("a", ToText::to_text(&name)) }
show(&f("b"))
```
entry = "main.taut"
checks."f" = "skipped"
diagnostics = []
stdout = ```
"ab"
```
